   "resumo_en": "Blast Off! is the fifth studio album by the American rockabilly revivalist band Stray Cats, released in 1989. It marked a reunion of the band, after three years of solo endeavors; the band's previous album, 1986's Rock Therapy, was produced to fulfill a record contract.\nThe album peaked at No. 111 on the Billboard 200. It peaked at No. 58 on the UK Albums Chart. The first single was \"Bring It Back Again\".\nThe band supported Blast Off! by touring with Stevie Ray Vaughan.",
